config LCD_SCREEN_DRIVER
	tristate "HD44780 LCD over PCF8574 I2C backpack"
	depends on I2C
	help
	  This driver registers an I2C client driver named "lcd-screen" for
	  HD44780-compatible displays connected through a PCF8574 backpack.
	  It exposes a character device at /dev/lcd-screen for writing text.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module name
	  is lcd_screen.
